"While our client portal connects with external platform APIs and third-party "
"tools, we are not responsible for policies on third-party websites outside "
"our core operating agreement."
msgstr ""

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_services
msgid ""
"With a strategic network across Europe, we streamline your storage and order "
"processing, wherever your business takes you.<br/><br/>"
msgstr ""

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_home
