"With reliable operations and <strong>a strategic network of warehouses "
"across Europe</strong>, we ensure your products are <strong>packed "
"accurately, securely and ready for dispatch</strong>."
msgstr ""

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
